    "title": "WTW M13B10 Basic watch face",
    "description": "This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 28+ like Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, Pixel Watch etc.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- Analog dial\r\n- 12/24hr Digital time based on phone settings\r\n- Batery percent\r\n- Daily step percentage\r\n- BPM heart rate\r\n- Steps counts\r\n- Day of month\r\n- Day of week (supports all languages)\r\n- Moon phase\r\n- Always On Display\r\n- 4 preset app shortcuts\r\n- 2 customizable app shortcuts\r\n\r\nCustomize app shortcuts:\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on customize option\r\n\r\nPreset APP Shortcuts:\r\n- Calendar\r\n- Alarm\r\n- Measure Heart Rate\r\n- Samsung Health\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions please send email to us. Thank you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 28+ like Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, Pixel Watch etc.<br><br>Features:<br><br>- Analog dial<br>- 12/24hr Digital time based on phone settings<br>- Batery percent<br>- Daily step percentage<br>- BPM heart rate<br>- Steps counts<br>- Day of month<br>- Day of week (supports all languages)<br>- Moon phase<br>- Always On Display<br>- 4 preset app shortcuts<br>- 2 customizable app shortcuts<br><br>Customize app shortcuts:<br>1 - Touch and hold display<br>2 - Tap on customize option<br><br>Preset APP Shortcuts:<br>- Calendar<br>- Alarm<br>- Measure Heart Rate<br>- Samsung Health<br><br>If you have any questions please send email to us. Thank you.",
